        "TileImage": "$($repository fb9c5d0b-e127-4ac5-950c-8e2c39528948).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. We come to Italy today as four individuals did something stupid.\r\rAfter a French A330 entered Italian airspace illegally last night, the four people on board parachuted out of the aircraft as it was shot down by the Italian Air Force. They landed just outside of Sapienza, and with Dino Bosco&apos;s short-handed staff, three of them easily got a job within a day.\r\rYou need to eliminate the four of them, before they find a way to leave the city and return to their country. Good luck.",
